        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 8 Hilltop Park, Cobh, Co. Cork – P24 HK37\r\nGuide Price: €380,000\r\n\r\nNo. 8 Hilltop Park is a well-maintained three-bedroom detached bungalow extending to approximately 62 sq. m., with a detached garage, rear outhouse, private driveway and a sunny south-facing rear garden.\r\nThe bright and practical accommodation comprises an entrance porch, hallway, comfortable sitting room with stove, kitchen/dining room, three bedrooms and a modern walk-in shower room. A spacious sunroom to the rear opens directly onto the garden, providing an additional area in which to relax and enjoy the property’s sunny aspect.\r\nPresented in good overall condition and ready for immediate occupation, the property also offers excellent potential for purchasers to upgrade and personalise the home over time.\r\nOutside, the private driveway provides off-street parking, while the detached garage and rear outhouse offer valuable storage space. The south-facing rear garden is a particularly attractive feature, providing a private outdoor area with excellent sunlight throughout the day.\r\nConveniently located close to schools, local amenities and transport links, No. 8 Hilltop Park will appeal to first-time buyers, downsizers and anyone seeking a detached home in a convenient Cobh location.\r\nBER: G\r\nBER No.: 119459121\r\n\r\nProperty Features\r\n•\tThree-bedroom detached bungalow \r\n•\tApproximately 62 sq. m. \r\n•\tPresented in good overall condition \r\n•\tDouble-glazed windows and doors \r\n•\tBright sitting room with stove \r\n•\tSpacious kitchen/dining room \r\n•\tModern walk-in shower room \r\n•\tSunroom opening onto the rear garden \r\n•\tSunny south-facing rear garden \r\n•\tDetached garage and rear outhouse \r\n•\tPrivate driveway with off-street parking \r\n•\tExcellent potential to upgrade and personalise \r\n•\tClose to schools, amenities and transport links \r\n•\tBER: G \r\n•\tBER No.: 119459121"
      },
